{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_title", "source_sha256": "cea00d282488294e16582436474b38e92c520ce5830093c07f145f0b61457d6f", "ja": "笑顔のなかで", "zh": "在笑容之中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e862bd8587aef031c162561b5d0c6c977aadc86e13d5e7549b98b36e2b918d1a", "ja": "センターを任された美奈子は、自分のこと\nそっちのけでメンバーのフォローを続け、\n場を盛り上げる。彼女のリラックス方法は\nいつも通りの、みんなへのお世話だった。\n育まれた温かい絆で、ステージは成功する。", "zh": "被选为Center的美奈子，\n总是将自己的事放在一旁，\n以协助团员为优先，让现场气氛热络起来。\n她放松的方法，就是一如既往地照顾大家。\n在彼此累积的深厚羁绊下，表演圆满落幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4b1fc018350431efe552668240da598f7da759c677a0912d407096432d656763", "ja": "美奈子、お疲れさま。\nこの間の公演のブログ読んだぞ。", "zh": "美奈子，辛苦你了。\n我看过先前公演的部落格文章啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "9480add3608d69c2db857fc26bdeaf4a657bb11797e5739e5e442a53b4e550ce", "ja": "わわっ！？　{$P$}さん、\nもう読んじゃったんですか？", "zh": "哇哇！？{$P$}先生，\n你已经看过了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "1367483da5012d8d5e56400f019490c29b9d73481aeba89bf3e4bb35a0677aac", "ja": "ファンの人に向けてのブログって、まだ慣れてないから\n……ちょっぴり、恥ずかしいなって。", "zh": "我还不习惯写部落格给粉丝看……\n所以觉得有一点点难为情啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1004_p", "source_sha256": "98d359b00012325632e473ba4813648c586c0ba25bfff08a2b89c1894ad2aa14", "ja": "言われてみると、\nちょっと文章が硬かったかもしれないな。", "zh": "经你这么一说，\n文字确实有点生硬呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "40a61f6dc3bc44a742507d0e8883ff6a0372bcff64001858c551432b857cf073", "ja": "や、やっぱりヘンでしたか？\nううっ、どうしよ～。", "zh": "果、果然很奇怪吗？\n呜呜，怎么办～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "026259f94cdf96bf1d6ec9c3e3d2b516884753197631f1e3280bca3a71d93c13", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！　{$P$}さん、\n今度ブログの書き方を教えてくれませんか？", "zh": "啊，对了！{$P$}先生，\n下次你可以教我怎么写部落格吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "9e6be0d8bcc8ac904b051b3539d986f99501146325a3131226fe84094dab0840", "ja": "私より{$P$}さんの方が、\nきっと詳しいと思うし……お願いします！", "zh": "{$P$}先生\n应该比我更了解……拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c9e4913076e0b6dd4f6fd1beca8dbd588cbf59b45338bd61f63e32da6c6af084", "ja": "と言われても、俺も自分が書くわけじゃないしな……\n一緒に考えることしかできないけど、それでもいいか？", "zh": "就算你这么说，我自己也没有在写部落格……\n最多只能陪你一起想，这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "fdc29dd96f8d0cb2892f36dc3b00bc37851baf79a267591585433908f3058c57", "ja": "はいっ、もちろんです！\nありがとうございますっ♪", "zh": "好的，当然没问题！\n谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "129690958d244a0fb505f94da2e5486eb5cfcd139eba28de62856692503eebc0", "ja": "あれ？　{$P$}さん、上着の袖口……\nまたほつれちゃってます？", "zh": "哎呀？{$P$}先生，\n你上衣的袖口……是不是又脱线了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c98583aa60e01ed2c8fca2f8afda5ae11773285212d4a12b1c7b035532051139", "ja": "あっ、本当だ。気づかなかったな……。", "zh": "啊，真的耶，我都没注意到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "f74d90e9349920463413e359723e054a151dc8353b0ac75391a2162a1ed7e57c", "ja": "私の縫い方が甘かったんですね。ごめんなさい！", "zh": "看来是我缝得不够紧，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "bf689e7b26d62f4144ed30ffa6a7b71049407ef6512f921613b39fe0de9091e3", "ja": "すぐに直します！って言いたいところですけど、\nもうすぐレッスンだから……。", "zh": "虽然很想说「我现在就重新缝」，\n但我马上就要去练习了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "1d369f0c76b4f1f1475a938e01d8a1be56af08c7c925ecebaa866e07683e236e", "ja": "夜になって落ち着いてから、\nしっかり直させてくださいね♪", "zh": "等晚上忙完后，\n我再好好帮你重新缝过喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2b06efb03d62dfdb53908bad6dcefae22ea68ecf51f27a742f06451c23ad7bee", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。\nでもレッスンこそ、しっかり頑張るんだぞ！", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你。\n不过练习的部分，才更需要好好加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "12393a1680ba6ea23e58bd9f8102396dba957fb021a3569530e47bd1aa269c24", "ja": "あ、そうですよね。えへへっ、頑張ります♪", "zh": "啊，说得也是。嘿嘿，我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_008_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d202e2d093bd8d064c929fb8bc851ff9359aeef0b8a9cde27072d4e18584fd47", "ja": "（世話焼きなのは相変わらずだけど……これからも\n美奈子には、どんどん成長していってもらわないとな）", "zh": "（她还是一样喜欢照顾别人……\n不过，今后也要让美奈子继续成长下去才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
